## Navigation Patterns

### Navigate to New Page
```typescript
// Basic
uni.navigateTo({ url: '/pages/mine/info/index' })

// With params
uni.navigateTo({
  url: `/pages/detail/index?id=${id}&name=${encodeURIComponent(name)}`
})

// Tab bar page (use switchTab)
uni.switchTab({ url: '/pages/index' })
```

### Redirect & Relaunch
```typescript
// Replace current page
uni.redirectTo({ url: '/pages/login' })

// Close all and navigate
uni.reLaunch({ url: '/pages/index' })
```

### Navigate Back
```typescript
uni.navigateBack()  // Back one page
uni.navigateBack({ delta: 2 })  // Back two pages
```

### Passing Parameters

**Via URL Query**:
```typescript
// Sender
uni.navigateTo({ url: `/pages/detail/index?id=${id}` })

// Receiver
import { onLoad } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onLoad((options) => {
  const id = options.id
})
```

**Via Global State**:
```typescript
// Sender
const dataStore = useDataStore()
dataStore.setData(complexData)
uni.navigateTo({ url: '/pages/detail/index' })

// Receiver
const data = useDataStore().getData()
```

## Page Lifecycle

```typescript
import { 
  onLoad, 
  onShow, 
  onReady, 
  onHide, 
  onUnload,
  onPullDownRefresh,
  onReachBottom
} from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

// Load once (with query params)
onLoad((options) => {
  console.log('Loaded with:', options)
})

// Show every time
onShow(() => {
  refreshData()
})

// DOM ready
onReady(() => {
  // DOM operations
})

// Page hide
onHide(() => {
  // Save state
})

// Page unload
onUnload(() => {
  // Cleanup
})

// Pull down refresh
onPullDownRefresh(async () => {
  await refreshData()
  uni.stopPullDownRefresh()
})

// Reach bottom
onReachBottom(() => {
  loadMore()
})
```

### Lifecycle Flow
1. `onLoad` → Called once when page loads
2. `onShow` → Called every time page shows
3. `onReady` → Called once when page is ready
4. `onHide` → Called when page is hidden
5. `onUnload` → Called when page is unloaded

## Common Patterns

### Load Data on Page Load
```typescript
import { ref } from 'vue'
import { onLoad } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'
import apis from '@/api'

const data = ref(null)

onLoad(async (options) => {
  try {
    uni.showLoading({ title: '加载中...' })
    data.value = await apis.getData(options.id)
  } finally {
    uni.hideLoading()
  }
})
```

### Refresh on Page Show
```typescript
import { onShow } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onShow(() => {
  refreshData()
})
```

### Pull-down Refresh
Enable in `pages.json`:
```json
{
  "path": "pages/list/index",
  "style": {
    "enablePullDownRefresh": true
  }
}
```

Then implement:
```typescript
import { onPullDownRefresh } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onPullDownRefresh(async () => {
  try {
    await refreshData()
  } finally {
    uni.stopPullDownRefresh()
  }
})
```

### Load More (Reach Bottom)
```typescript
import { ref } from 'vue'
import { onReachBottom } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

const loading = ref(false)
const finished = ref(false)

onReachBottom(() => {
  if (!loading.value && !finished.value) {
    loadMore()
  }
})
```

## Permission Handling

### Check Permissions
```typescript
import { computed } from 'vue'
import { useUserStore } from '@/store/user'

const userStore = useUserStore()

const canDelete = computed(() => 
  userStore.hasPermission('system:user:remove')
)

const isAdmin = computed(() => userStore.hasRole('admin'))
```

### Conditional Rendering
```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
const userStore = useUserStore()
const canDelete = computed(() => 
  userStore.hasPermission('system:user:remove')
)
</script>

<template>
  <button v-if="canDelete" @click="handleDelete">删除</button>
</template>
```

### Route Guards
```typescript
// /src/permission.ts
import { useUserStore } from '@/store/user'
import { showToastAsync } from '@/utils/promisify'

const whiteList = ['/pages/login', '/pages/register']

export async function checkAuth(url: string): Promise<boolean> {
  const userStore = useUserStore()
  
  if (whiteList.some(path => url.includes(path))) {
    return true
  }
  
  if (!userStore.token) {
    await showToastAsync({ title: '请先登录', icon: 'none' })
    uni.reLaunch({ url: '/pages/login' })
    return false
  }
  
  return true
}
```

## Page-Specific Features

### Custom Navigation Bar
```json
{
  "path": "pages/index",
  "style": {
    "navigationStyle": "custom"
  }
}
```

Then in component:
```vue
<template>
  <view class="page">
    <view class="nav-bar" :style="{ paddingTop: statusBarHeight + 'px' }">
      <text class="nav-title">标题</text>
    </view>
    <view class="content">
      <!-- Page content -->
    </view>
  </view>
</template>
```

### Share Menu
```typescript
import { onShareAppMessage } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onShareAppMessage(() => {
  return {
    title: '分享标题',
    path: '/pages/index',
    imageUrl: '/static/images/share.jpg'
  }
})
```

### Dynamic Title
```typescript
import { onLoad } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onLoad((options) => {
  uni.setNavigationBarTitle({
    title: options.title || '默认标题'
  })
})
```

## Best Practices

1. **Use onShow for data refresh** - Data may be stale when returning
2. **Clean up in onHide/onUnload** - Remove listeners, clear timers
3. **Handle navigation errors**
4. **Use absolute paths** - `/pages/mine/index` not `pages/mine/index`
5. **Encode URL parameters** - `encodeURIComponent(name)`
6. **Check navigation stack** - Max 10 pages, use redirectTo if needed
